<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Sales Letter</title>

    <style>
        body{
            font-family:"Times New Roman", serif;
            margin:40px;
            background-color:white;
        }

        h1{
            font-size:55px;
            margin-bottom:10px;
        }

        hr{
            border:1px solid #bdbdbd;
        }

        .image{
            text-align:center;
            margin:25px 0 35px;
        }

        .image img{
            width:180px;
            height:auto;
        }

        .address{
            font-size:22px;
            line-height:1.5;
        }

        .date{
            margin-top:25px;
            font-size:22px;
        }

        .receiver{
            margin-top:25px;
            font-style:italic;
            font-size:22px;
            line-height:1.5;
        }

        .subject{
            margin-top:30px;
            font-size:32px;
        }

        .content{
            margin-top:20px;
            font-size:22px;
            line-height:1.8;
            text-align:justify;
        }

        .signature{
            text-align:right;
            margin-top:35px;
            font-size:22px;
            line-height:1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>SALES LETTER</h1>

<hr>

<div class="image">
    <img src="books.jpg" alt="Books">
</div>

<div class="address">
<b>European Books Ltd</b><br>
20<sup>st</sup> Johns Road<br>
London 3W11 2Q3 ENGLAND<br>
Tele: 01712169191 &nbsp;&nbsp; Fax: 0712160000
</div>

<div class="date">
December 24<sup>th</sup>, 2019
</div>

<div class="receiver">
IA LIBRARY INTERNATIONALE<br>
24 Place Castelle<br>
13006 Marseille<br>
FRANCE
</div>

<div class="subject">
CUSTOMER
</div>

<div class="content">

<p>
We have great pleasure in sending you a brochure about a new series of
three textbook <b>FLUENT ENGLISH</b> which provides interesting,
challenging and provocative reading and discussion materials for
students learning English at an upper-intermediate or advanced level.
</p>

<p>
Inside the brochure, you will find a reply coupon to be completed and
returned to European Books in London by June 30<sup>th</sup>.
We will send you a specimen copy giving you a chance to examine
<b>FLUENT ENGLISH</b> in more detail.
</p>

<p>
If you have any queries concerning this new publication,
please do not hesitate to contact us at the above address.
</p>

</div>

<hr>

<div class="signature">
Yours sincerely,<br>
<b>Peter Jones</b><br>
Marketing<br>
Manager<br><br>

Encl: 1 brochure
</div>

</body>
</html>
